{"id":"a20c378d3cca949f","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp.md","title":"Håstad 三查询线性 PCP 定理","display":"thm-hastad-three-query-pcp — Håstad 三查询线性 PCP 定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp","aliases":["28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp"],"display":"thm-hastad-three-query-pcp — Håstad 三查询线性 PCP 定理","depends_on":["[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 22.16","source_printed_pages":"474","source_pdf_pages":"500","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hastad-three-query-pcp — Håstad 三查询线性 PCP 定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 22.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"474"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"500"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\)</span> 为固定只读证明；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 的值是二进制字串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(i)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\)</span> 是正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示；字串乘积表示依次拼接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 是单比特字串。\n下式给出查询四元组的单射编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}\\)</span>、线性接受谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinAcc}\">\\(\\operatorname{LinAcc}\\)</span> 及合法有界查询码集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_B\">\\(\\mathcal Q_B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上的均匀分布；每个概率只对独立均匀随机带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 取值；同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 改变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cint}(i)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}(i_1,i_2,i_3,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cint}(i_1)\\operatorname{cint}(i_2)\\operatorname{cint}(i_3)\\langle b\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cint}(i)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}(i_1,i_2,i_3,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cint}(i_1)\\operatorname{cint}(i_2)\\operatorname{cint}(i_3)\\langle b\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_B\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}(i_1,i_2,i_3,b):(i_1,i_2,i_3)\\in[B]^3,\\ b\\in\\Sigma\\}\\quad(B\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal Q_B\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}(i_1,i_2,i_3,b):(i_1,i_2,i_3)\\in[B]^3,\\ b\\in\\Sigma\\}\\quad(B\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinAcc}(\\pi,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists i_1,i_2,i_3\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\;\\left[z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}(i_1,i_2,i_3,b)\\land\\pi(i_1)+\\pi(i_2)+\\pi(i_3)\\equiv b\\pmod2\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LinAcc}(\\pi,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists i_1,i_2,i_3\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\;\\left[z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{qry}}(i_1,i_2,i_3,b)\\land\\pi(i_1)+\\pi(i_2)+\\pi(i_3)\\equiv b\\pmod2\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\delta\\in(0,1/2)\\;\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;\\exists Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists c,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil}\\quad Q(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r))\\in\\mathcal Q_{c(|x|+2)^a}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil}}[\\operatorname{LinAcc}(\\pi,Q(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)))]\\ge1-\\delta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil}}[\\operatorname{LinAcc}(\\pi,Q(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)))]\\le1/2+\\delta].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\delta\\in(0,1/2)\\;\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;\\exists Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists c,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil}\\quad Q(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r))\\in\\mathcal Q_{c(|x|+2)^a}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil}}[\\operatorname{LinAcc}(\\pi,Q(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)))]\\ge1-\\delta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\quad\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil}}[\\operatorname{LinAcc}(\\pi,Q(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)))]\\le1/2+\\delta].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>查询算法保持为本目录的一元字符串函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>；四元组通过逐整数自分隔编码进入字符串值域。长度头唯一确定每个地址块，末位给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，所以编码单射，编解码成本为码长的多项式。合法样本上的查询输出范围在第一行显式限定；非法查询串使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinAcc}\">\\(\\operatorname{LinAcc}\\)</span> 为假。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 先固定，算法与常数可依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>。重复地址仍按三次读值的模二和计算；完整性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-\\delta\">\\(1-\\delta\\)</span>、可靠性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2+\\delta\">\\(1/2+\\delta\\)</span>、对数随机位和三查询线性条件保持原文陈述。这里补齐输出编码和量词接口，不声称完成 PCP 构造的机器证明。</p>\n<p>原包出处：Arora–Barak, Theorem 22.16，印刷页 474；PDF 页 500。历史来源核验字段沿用原包，本次未获取原包所称的本地 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","loca